B.a67=new A.N(B.cq,["Full-Stack Web Developer","Latakia University","Developed a responsive website for the Mechatronics Department using Flutter Web, creating a modern and accessible platform for students, faculty, and department activities. Integrated Firebase for backend services, data management, and dynamic content. Designed reusable Flutter components and responsive layouts to ensure a consistent experience across desktop and mobile devices. Collaborated with the department to translate requirements into a maintainable and production-ready web application.",2025,3,2025,5,B.aY,B.v_],t.M)
