B.a63=new A.N(B.cq,["Full-Stack Mobile Developer","Robotics Club","Developed and maintained full-stack mobile applications using Flutter and Django, building scalable APIs and responsive cross-platform user interfaces. Designed and integrated PostgreSQL and SQLite databases, implementing secure data management and efficient backend services with Python. Containerized applications with Docker and supported cloud deployment and infrastructure using AWS. Collaborated with the team to deliver reliable, production-ready solutions from backend architecture to mobile application development.",2024,1,2024,6,B.aY,B.o],t.M)
