B.a65=new A.N(B.cq,["Dual Arms Developer","Robotics Club","Developed and integrated software for a dual-arm robotic system, working across motion control, robotics middleware, computer vision, and user interfaces. Built ROS-based components using C++, Python, and OpenCV for robotic control, perception, and system communication. Developed supporting cross-platform applications with Flutter, Dart, Firebase, and Qt, collaborating with the team to integrate, test, and optimize the complete robotic platform.",2022,9,2023,10,B.uz,B.o],t.M)
