B.a5H=new A.N(B.d8,["Qio","A full-stack mobile marketplace platform connecting users with offers and services through a modern Flutter application and Django REST API backend. Implemented JWT authentication, user profiles, offers, messaging, notifications, and wallet/payment functionality with PostgreSQL-based data management. Integrated Firebase Cloud Messaging and Google Mobile Ads, along with deep linking and secure API communication. Deployed and maintained the backend infrastructure while optimizing the application for production use.","https://alijohn.my.canva.site/",B.bR,"assets/images/qio.png",B.aY,B.wi],t.M)
