B.a7I=new A.N(B.Ei,["I'm a software developer specializing in Flutter and Django, passionate about building reliable, user-focused mobile applications and scalable backend systems.\nWith 4+ years of experience in software development, I've worked across mobile development, REST APIs, Firebase, and backend systems, turning ideas into practical and production-ready solutions.\nMy interests also include C++, embedded systems, robotics, cybersecurity, and AI, allowing me to explore the intersection of software and intelligent systems.\nI'm driven by solving challenging problems, learning new technologies, and building meaningful products that create real value.","Ali Yousef","Flutter & Django Developer","Mobile \u2022 Backend \u2022 Software Systems","Mobile App Developer","Systems Engineering",B.v4,B.uZ,B.a__,"Present",B.a3u,B.uX,B.a5Y,"Portfolio","Home","About","About Me","Experience","Projects","Resume","Download resume","Could not open the url","Language unknown","About Project"],t.yf)
